    "title": "Tips for Adding Vintage to Your Wardrobe from Georgia Tastemaker - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michiel Perry ,\n9 hours ago Looking to add vintage to your wardrobe? We have you covered. Discover expert tips on infusing your wardrobe with vintage charm, courtesy of Georgia tastemaker Kenya Brantley, owner of Greenhouse Mercantile. Learn how to effortlessly incorporate pieces with history, soul, and character into your everyday style. Her latest drop of vintage fashion at her curated shop in Newnan, GA is exactly what you need and she gives the inside scoop on adding vintage to your wardrobe. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
